{
  "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Auction update — LotVanta</title><style>@media only screen and (max-width:600px){.outer{padding:24px 16px!important}.content{padding:24px!important}}</style></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;background:#F5F6F8;color:#151A30;font-family:'Schibsted Grotesk', Arial, sans-serif;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;\">Your bid was overtaken. Check the latest price.</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td class=\"outer\" align=\"center\" style=\"padding:48px 16px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:600px;background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E3E6EC;border-radius:12px;\"><tr><td class=\"content\" style=\"padding:32px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 24px;background:#1C2A6B;border-bottom:4px solid #FFC629;border-radius:8px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:20px 24px\"><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"background:#FFFFFF;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px\"><img src=\"cid:lotvanta-brand-logo\" alt=\"LotVanta\" width=\"176\" style=\"display:block;width:176px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;color:#1C2A6B;font-size:22px;font-weight:700\"></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;color:#FFC629;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:700\">Bid. Win. Save.</p></td></tr></table>\n<h1 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:24px;line-height:30px;\">You were outbid</h1>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 24px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;\">Another bid moved ahead of yours. Open the item to check the latest price and decide whether to bid again.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#556074;font-size:14px;\">Item {{lotNumber}}</p>\n<h2 style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;font-size:20px;line-height:26px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">{{title}}</h2>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-top:1px solid #E3E6EC;border-bottom:1px solid #E3E6EC;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:16px 0;color:#556074;\">Price at the time</td><td align=\"right\" style=\"padding:16px 0;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;\">{{price}}</td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:24px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;\">Your private bidding limit stays private. Check the current price, closing time and total cost before confirming another bid.</p>\n<a href=\"{{itemUrl}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:16px 24px;border-radius:8px;background:#1C2A6B;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;\">View item and bid again</a>\n<p style=\"margin:32px 0 0;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #E3E6EC;color:#556074;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;\">You received this update because you placed a bid on this item. LotVanta staff will never ask for your sign-in code.</p>\n</td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:24px 0 0;color:#556074;font-size:12px;\">LotVanta · Your bid update</p></td></tr></table></body></html>",
  "text": "LotVanta\n\nYou were outbid\nAnother bid moved ahead of yours. Open the item to check the latest price and decide whether to bid again.\n\n{{title}}\nItem {{lotNumber}}\nPrice at the time: {{price}}\n\nYour private bidding limit stays private. Check the current price, closing time and total cost before confirming another bid.\nView item and bid again: {{itemUrl}}\n\nYou received this update because you placed a bid on this item. LotVanta staff will never ask for your sign-in code."
}
